<title>USA: Red Roof Inns sets share buyback program.</title>
<headline>Red Roof Inns sets share buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>HILLIARD, Ohio 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red Roof Inns Inc said Wednesday it will repurchase up to 500,000 common shares to fulfill requirements for its employee stock purchase and management stock option plans.</p>
<p>The shares will be purchased on the open market or in negotiated transactions, depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>Red Roof shares traded off 3/4 to 15-5/8 on Wednesday morning.</p>
